{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Benefits:\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your body while playing a video game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make leg day more fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamify your workout.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909060/extras/f449ffa27569b46af9217152583cae42.poster.avif?t=1771256040\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909060/extras/f449ffa27569b46af9217152583cae42.webm?t=1771256040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a runner game but to jump you do a real life squat! The game uses the camera to detect squats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909060/extras/bc89e264a30042c90ec71e3375625acf.poster.avif?t=1771256040\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909060/extras/bc89e264a30042c90ec71e3375625acf.webm?t=1771256040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game gets faster as you get from stage to stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909060/extras/874639851c46021f57911255e1d696af.poster.avif?t=1771256040\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909060/extras/874639851c46021f57911255e1d696af.webm?t=1771256040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Squat a certain amount of times and get a sword powerup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909060/extras/02eada25d018e87459c703e2c0e524e2.avif?t=1771256040\" width=1560 height=471 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909060?t=1771256040","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909060?t=1771256040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909060/dcb2b814c09f11769b5d29aaf7cd06589ba242f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771256040","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909060/dcb2b814c09f11769b5d29aaf7cd06589ba242f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771256040","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Benefits:\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your body while playing a video game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make leg day more fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamify your workout.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909060/extras/f449ffa27569b46af9217152583cae42.poster.avif?t=1771256040\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909060/extras/f449ffa27569b46af9217152583cae42.webm?t=17712560